      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel exhausted and cynical when the system seems fundamentally rigged against you. Feeling like a ghost in a corrupt world is a crushing weight to carry. While the scope of large systems can feel insurmountable, sometimes the point isn't to \"win\" the whole battle, but to find small pockets of peace or to focus on what you can control for your own survival. Please remember that your worth is not determined by the outcome of a corporate fight.",
      "source": "target",
